{"data":[{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-11T04:22:43.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109137594584109412"],"id":"2109137594584109412","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1553,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108803101390258654","type":"quoted"}],"text":"This guy is talking about the Bengalis of the Bangladesh.\n\nThe Indian Bengalis consume everything on all days of Durga Puja, including Mahalaya.\n\nPersonally, I had Mutton Biryani. What about you all? https://t.co/kiHQinxZjO","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2109137594584109412"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2108960727675592704","3_2108960757849399296","3_2108960789050929152","3_2108960810915794946"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-10T16:40:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108960827734892841"],"id":"2108960827734892841","in_reply_to_user_id":"4764615733","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":291,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108960710332191159","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"📍 Tala Prattoy.\n\n🎨 Susanta Shibani Paul. 🐐 \n\n👉 As usual, Susanta da has taken us to the mystical world of his. Absolutely mesmerizing. I loved it. Tala Prattoy is well &amp; truly back!\n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 2/2 https://t.co/CwWjqWgLkB","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2108960827734892841"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2108960430681133057","3_2108960446481158144","3_2108960462872444928","3_2108960503888576512"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-10T16:39:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108960710332191159"],"id":"2108960710332191159","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":1548,"like_count":40,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":5},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108533573976506750","type":"quoted"}],"text":"📍 Tala Prattoy.\n\n🎨 Susanta Shibani Paul. 🐐 \n\n🌟 The theme depicts 'detatchment' from the reality, and reaching the unknown — that is, the Shakti, or Maa Durga — bringing us together.\n\n👉 First Durga Puja of the year, and it was FANTASTIC! 🔥 \n\n📌 #DurgaPuja2026\n\n🧵 1/2 https://t.co/DDjBSYsX82 https://t.co/92sPkGv9CP","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2108960710332191159"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-10T14:28:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108927603017200112"],"id":"2108927603017200112","in_reply_to_user_id":"4764615733","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":260,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108927093258256701","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"This is Telipukur Yuba Sangha near Nagerbazar.\n\nOne of the 8 pujas of Adani.\n\nLed by BJP Bengal President, Samik Bhattacharya.\n\nArt by Bhabatosh Sutar.","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2108927603017200112"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2108927074803322880"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-10T14:26:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108927093258256701"],"id":"2108927093258256701","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":888,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":1},"text":"MassArt used to handle 20-25 major Durga Pujas flawlessly.\n\nAll the pandals were always completed by Mahalaya.\n\nThen, there is this Adani Durga Puja Preview.\n\nAbsolutely horrendous.\n\nI travelled for 15+km, only to see an incomplete pandal, that too without Maa Durga. https://t.co/CvvXFwkd5i","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2108927093258256701"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-10T08:26:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108836500528050379"],"id":"2108836500528050379","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":499,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108836074856604145","type":"quoted"}],"text":"Dilli Haat is the new Jantar Mantar.\n\nThe protest shall not stop.\n\nThe demand, however, should now be the resignation of PM Narendra Modi.\n\nEnough is enough.\n\nLong live democracy! https://t.co/Upav7kOk5Z","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2108836500528050379"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2108836053583028224","3_2108836066145042432"]},"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-10T08:24:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108836074856604145"],"id":"2108836074856604145","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":844,"like_count":12,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":1},"text":"How BJP treat convicted r*pists\n\n🆚\n\nHow BJP treat rightful &amp; peaceful protestors https://t.co/exVOxix4nL","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2108836074856604145"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-10T08:16:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108834119622787354"],"id":"2108834119622787354","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":1160,"like_count":26,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Viksit Bharat 2047 will happen.\n\nBut BJP Mukt Bharat will happen first.\n\nThe beginning of the end has already begun, with the detention of Abhijit Dipke, Saurav Das &amp; Ashutosh Ranka.\n\nMay the Cockroaches stand tall and defeat these dictators!\n\nMay Maa Durga defeat the BJP Asur!","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2108834119622787354"},{"author_id":"4764615733","created_at":"2026-10-10T08:13:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2108833240283074649"],"id":"2108833240283074649","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":802,"like_count":22,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2108821604176167390","type":"quoted"}],"text":"The Great Dictator 56 &amp; Taklu Maharaj are falling. It's happening. That's how Adolf Hitler, Indira Gandhi, and all the other dictators fell eventually. https://t.co/LLdyk5jGJD","url":"https://x.com/abasu4ever/status/2108833240283074649"},{"author_id":"4764615733